msgstr ""
"Finely chiselled Sauvignon on flint and white soils, taut and mineral, with a nose of citrus and "
"blackcurrant bud."

msgid "Sauvignon de la rive droite, plus ample et plus fumé, où la pierre à fusil domine le fruit."
msgstr "Right-bank Sauvignon, fuller and smokier, where gunflint dominates the fruit."

msgid "Savoie"
